"Total profiled T-states since last Reset.\n"
"= sum of Excl across all buckets."
msgstr ""
"Celkovy poczet profilovanych T-stavu od posledniho Resetu.\n"
"= souczet Excl przes wszystkie buckety."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1168
msgid ""
"Total on_enter events (CALL + RST + IRQ + NMI accepts)\n"
"since last Reset. = sum of Calls column."
msgstr ""
"Celkovy poczet on_enter udalosti (przyjęcie CALL + RST + IRQ + NMI)\n"
"od posledniho Resetu. = souczet kolumny Calls."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1178
msgid ""
"How many of 'Calls' were IRQ or NMI accept events\n"
"(= IM 0 / IM 1 / IM 2 / NMI, not CALL or RST)."
msgstr ""
"Kolik z 'Calls' bylo udalosti przyjęcie IRQ nebo NMI\n"
"(= IM 0 / IM 1 / IM 2 / NMI, nikoli CALL nebo RST)."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1188
msgid ""
"RET / RETI / RETN events with no paired CALL in shadow\n"
"stack ('divergent returns').\n"
"\n"
"Causes:\n"
"  - PUSH addr + RET trampoline (BDOS dispatch tables)\n"
"  - longjmp pattern (restore SP and RET)\n"
"  - self-modifying return address on stack\n"
"  - ISR ending with RET instead of RETI\n"
"\n"
"Profiler skips these in aggregation (no paired enter).\n"
"\n"
"0 or a few = OK, data trustworthy.\n"
"Growing steadily = multi-stack OS pattern (CP/M, NIPOS)\n"
"= V1 measurements NOT accurate, waiting on callstack\n"
"V1.5+ scope BPs."
msgstr ""
"RET / RETI / RETN udalosti bez sparovanego CALL v shadow\n"
"stosu ('divergentni navraty').\n"
"\n"
"Przicziny:\n"
"  - PUSH addr + RET trampolina (dispatch tabulky BDOS)\n"
"  - longjmp wzór (obnovit SP a RET)\n"
"  - sebemodifikujici navratova adresa na stosie\n"
"  - ISR konczici RET misto RETI\n"
"\n"
"Profiler tyto v agregaci przeskakuje (brak sparovany enter).\n"
"\n"
"0 nebo par = OK, data duveryhodna.\n"
"Stale roste = wzór multi-stack OS (CP/M, NIPOS)\n"
"= merzeni V1 NEJSOU przesna, czeka se na callstack\n"
"V1.5+ scope BPs."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1211
msgid ""
"Unique (target_addr, kind) entries in the aggregator.\n"
"Each bucket = one row in the table.\n"
"\n"
"A bucket is created at first entry to that\n"
"(address, kind) combination. Cleared only by Reset.\n"
"\n"
"Typical Z80 game / demo: tens to hundreds.\n"
"Thousands and growing = SMC or banked code mixing\n"
"into the same buckets, data may be misleading.\n"
"\n"
"Memory cost: ~64 B per bucket."
msgstr ""
"Unikatni wpisy (target_addr, kind) v agregatorze.\n"
"Każdy bucket = jeden wiersz v tabulce.\n"
"\n"
"Bucket vznika przi prvnim vstupu na danou kombinaci\n"
"(adresa, druh). Mażou se pouze Resetem.\n"
"\n"
"Typicka Z80 hra / demo: desitky aż stovky.\n"
"Tisice a stale roste = SMC nebo banked kód mixujici\n"
"do stejnych bucketu, data mohou byt zavadejici.\n"
"\n"
"Pamięćove naklady: ~64 B na bucket."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1233
msgid ""
"Parallel stack push beyond PROFILER_MAX_DEPTH (256).\n"
"Extreme nesting depth - shouldn't happen in normal Z80\n"
"code. Investigate or Reset."
msgstr ""
"Push na paralelni stos nad PROFILER_MAX_DEPTH (256).\n"
"Extremni hloubka zagnieżdżenia - v normalnim Z80 kódu by se\n"
"stavat nemelo. Prozkoumejte nebo dejte Reset."

